      "page": 207,
      "ruku": 171,
      "hizbQuarter": 83,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1364,
      "text": "But if they turn away, then say, “Allah is sufficient for me; none has the right to be worshiped except Him[94]; in Him I put my trust, and He is the Lord of the Mighty Throne.”",
